00:43:00.040 --> 00:43:08.620
Toby's rage is simmering quietly in the annex, and it comes out in the form of the Scranton

850
00:43:08.620 --> 00:43:09.180
Strangler.

851
00:43:10.280 --> 00:43:12.700
Toby is the Scranton Strangler.

852
00:43:12.960 --> 00:43:16.740
Don't doubt it, because if you do, he will have fooled you, too.

853
00:43:17.560 --> 00:43:19.160
Oh, wow.

854
00:43:20.720 --> 00:43:21.900
That's my rebuttal.

